-- ============================================================================
-- OPTIMIZATION NOTES
-- ============================================================================
-- 1. DepartmentLeadership table added - replaces Departments.head_employee_uuid
-- 2. Deprecated tables marked for removal: Actions, Scopes, LevelAllowances, etc.
-- 3. Performance indexes added for common query patterns
-- 4. Next step: Data migration (see QUICK_WINS.sql)
-- ============================================================================
